# Learning

- After every meaningful task, add a `## Task: <name>` section to `docs/LEARNING_GUIDE.md`.
- Explain what was built, why, the flow, the analogy, the code locations, failure behavior, tradeoffs, and interview questions.
- Tie every explanation to TaskFlow files. Do not paste generic theory.
- Label behavior that is not in code as planned.
- Interview answers may describe only what the code and tests do.
